{
  "about": "What the 1.1 build (tag v1.1-20261028.2041, commit f238116) sends and relies on: the TestFlight beta (com.angilyu.littleexplorer.beta, channel testflight) and the same code on the App Store (channel appstore). On top of 1.0 it asks GET /app/version, sends reading events and asks for reading progress, and warms Milo (POST /milo/warm). Every request carries `headers` (X-App-Version/Build/Channel, from addClientHeaders) except content file downloads, which carry none. test_client_compat.py replays these requests without headers and with 1.1 App Store headers; test_client_compat_1_1.py replays them with this build's own headers on both channels. Responses may gain fields; never remove or retype one, and never change a status. Add a new file for the next release instead of editing this one.",
